      "content": "<p style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 20px;\"><strong>漂泊者首次抵達索拉里斯</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>。</strong></span></p>",
